rify.\",\n    \"spec_ref\": null,\n    \"meta_ref\": null,\n    \"plan_ref\": null,\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"blocked_by\": [],\n    \"closed_reason\": \"Merged in PR #546. Replaced 224 lines of static analysis in tests/daemon-api-meta.test.ts and 166 lines in tests/daemon-api-validation.test.ts with 34 Playwright E2E tests in packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-meta.spec.ts. All ACs (ac-15 through ac-21) covered with real HTTP calls against running daemon. Fixed Codex review issues: trait N/A annotations moved outside JSDoc block comment for machine parseability, added all 5 inherited traits with complete N/A annotations (29 total trait ACs), added @multi-directory-daemon ac-24 annotation. All CI checks passed.\",\n    \"depends_on\": [],\n    \"context\": [],\n    \"priority\": 2,\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"testing\",\n      \"daemon\",\n      \"e2e\"\n    ],\n    \"vcs_refs\": [],\n    \"session_id\": \"01KJBZXXNHE3M4WX1BZ6Z5ZNCJ\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T00:28:44.505Z\",\n    \"started_at\": \"2026-02-26T04:08:50.834Z\",\n    \"submitted_at\": \"2026-02-26T04:17:00.251Z\",\n    \"completed_at\": \"2026-02-26T04:32:53.831Z\",\n    \"notes\": [\n      {\n        \"_ulid\": \"01KJC2KF217ZY93C87QTBASQG8\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T04:16:37.953Z\",\n        \"author\": \"@claude\",\n        \"content\": \"Written packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-meta.spec.ts with 34 Playwright E2E tests covering @api-contract ac-15 through ac-21. Tests use daemon fixture for real HTTP calls. Deleted tests/daemon-api-meta.test.ts (224 lines) and tests/daemon-api-validation.test.ts (166 lines) of static analysis. Unit test run: all shards pass.\",\n        \"supersedes\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"_ulid\": \"01KJC324XTHXJHPVC0K3Y9WJ28\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T04:24:39.099Z\",\n        \"author\": \"@claude\",\n        \"content\": \"[FIX: Codex review] Fixed 3 issues: (1) Moved trait N/A annotations out of JSDoc block comment to stand